{
  "page": 589,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5883,
      "text": "while sitting on the couches, gazing around.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5884,
      "text": "Have the disbelievers been rewarded except for what they used to do?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 83,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُطَفِّفِينَ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mutaffifin",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Defrauding",
        "numberOfAyahs": 36,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 525,
      "hizbQuarter": 235,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5885,
      "text": "When the sky is rent asunder,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5886,
      "text": "and hearkens to its Lord[1], as it must,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5887,
      "text": "and when the earth is leveled out[2],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5888,
      "text": "and casts out all what it contains[3], and becomes empty,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5889,
      "text": "and hearkens to its Lord, as it must,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5890,
      "text": "O humans, you are toiling towards your Lord[4], and you will surely meet Him[5].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5891,
      "text": "Whoever is given his Record in his right hand,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5892,
      "text": "he will have an easy reckoning,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5893,
      "text": "and he will return to his people joyfully.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5894,
      "text": "But whoever is given his Record from behind his back,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5895,
      "text": "he will call out for destruction,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5896,
      "text": "and he will enter the Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5897,
      "text": "Indeed, he used to live among his people joyfully.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5898,
      "text": "and he thought that he would never return [to Allah].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5899,
      "text": "Indeed he will! His Lord was always watching him.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5900,
      "text": "Indeed, I swear by the twilight,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5901,
      "text": "and by the night and what it covers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5902,
      "text": "and by the moon when it becomes full,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5903,
      "text": "You will surely pass from one stage to another[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5904,
      "text": "Then what is the matter with them that they do not believe,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5905,
      "text": "and when the Qur’an is recited to them, they do not prostrate?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": {
        "id": 14,
        "recommended": true,
        "obligatory": false
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 5906,
      "text": "Rather, the disbelievers persist in denying it,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5907,
      "text": "but Allah knows best whatever they harbor in their hearts.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5908,
      "text": "So give them the tidings of a painful punishment.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5909,
      "text": "But those who believe and do righteous deeds will have a never-ending reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 84,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الانشِقَاقِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Inshiqaaq",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Splitting Open",
        "numberOfAyahs": 25,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 589,
      "ruku": 526,
      "hizbQuarter": 236,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
